    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Stillborn Slayer, an intense and challenging bullet hell RPG game set in the godforsaken lands of the Dark Continent, where the Ichor of the Horned God has corrupted and blighted everything in its path, bringing about a never-ending night, shattered earth, and time loops. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/c28cf21084318d0e970640862ff223b7.poster.avif?t=1726173039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/c28cf21084318d0e970640862ff223b7.webm?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/c28cf21084318d0e970640862ff223b7.mp4?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>As a nameless deceased adventurer, you've been resurrected by a necromancer to end the Curse and defeat the Horned God, battling against incomprehensible monsters and possessed physical avatars of mortal sins. Explore dense thickets and desolate fortresses in your quest, upgrading your gear and confronting more than 10 excruciatingly hard boss fights that will test your skills and require you to think on the go.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/98a6e50952c58101a958a9ded5b34d5c.poster.avif?t=1726173039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/98a6e50952c58101a958a9ded5b34d5c.webm?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/98a6e50952c58101a958a9ded5b34d5c.mp4?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>With bullet hell gameplay, you must master dodging and rolling skills and learn to use countless projectile types with different effects and properties to survive. In addition, you'll encounter various levels filled with loot, monsters, secrets, and eccentric companions, providing opportunities for exploration and discovery.<br><br>The game's complex combat and build system will require you to strategically choose from various characters, weapons, and artifacts to fight different builds. The mechanics of restoring stamina and mana will add an extra layer of challenge, keeping you on your toes during battles.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/d3d11c549cb3c934879aff393db08507.poster.avif?t=1726173039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/d3d11c549cb3c934879aff393db08507.webm?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/d3d11c549cb3c934879aff393db08507.mp4?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>If you're up for the challenge, enter the world of Stillborn Slayer and become the hero who ends the Curse and saves the Dark Continent from the Horned God's reign.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pixel-art design in a cursed Dark Continent<br></li><li>Challenging boss fights with unique gameplay features<br></li><li>Complex combat with a variety of characters, weapons, and artifacts<br></li><li>Exciting exploration with dense thickets, desolate fortresses, and eccentric companions<br></li><li>Intense bullet hell gameplay requires dodging and rolling skills to survive.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to Stillborn Slayer, an intense and challenging bullet hell RPG game set in the godforsaken lands of the Dark Continent, where the Ichor of the Horned God has corrupted and blighted everything in its path, bringing about a never-ending night, shattered earth, and time loops. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/c28cf21084318d0e970640862ff223b7.poster.avif?t=1726173039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/c28cf21084318d0e970640862ff223b7.webm?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/c28cf21084318d0e970640862ff223b7.mp4?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>As a nameless deceased adventurer, you've been resurrected by a necromancer to end the Curse and defeat the Horned God, battling against incomprehensible monsters and possessed physical avatars of mortal sins. Explore dense thickets and desolate fortresses in your quest, upgrading your gear and confronting more than 10 excruciatingly hard boss fights that will test your skills and require you to think on the go.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/98a6e50952c58101a958a9ded5b34d5c.poster.avif?t=1726173039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/98a6e50952c58101a958a9ded5b34d5c.webm?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/98a6e50952c58101a958a9ded5b34d5c.mp4?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>With bullet hell gameplay, you must master dodging and rolling skills and learn to use countless projectile types with different effects and properties to survive. In addition, you'll encounter various levels filled with loot, monsters, secrets, and eccentric companions, providing opportunities for exploration and discovery.<br><br>The game's complex combat and build system will require you to strategically choose from various characters, weapons, and artifacts to fight different builds. The mechanics of restoring stamina and mana will add an extra layer of challenge, keeping you on your toes during battles.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/d3d11c549cb3c934879aff393db08507.poster.avif?t=1726173039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/d3d11c549cb3c934879aff393db08507.webm?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851560/extras/d3d11c549cb3c934879aff393db08507.mp4?t=1726173039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>If you're up for the challenge, enter the world of Stillborn Slayer and become the hero who ends the Curse and saves the Dark Continent from the Horned God's reign.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Pixel-art design in a cursed Dark Continent<br></li><li>Challenging boss fights with unique gameplay features<br></li><li>Complex combat with a variety of characters, weapons, and artifacts<br></li><li>Exciting exploration with dense thickets, desolate fortresses, and eccentric companions<br></li><li>Intense bullet hell gameplay requires dodging and rolling skills to survive.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Stillborn Slayer is a beautifully crafted pixel-art bullet hell action-roguelike game set in a cursed Dark Continent, with challenging boss fights, exploration, and complex combat. Master dodging and rolling skills to fight incomprehensible monsters and slay the Horned God to end the Curse.",
